        "startNode": "briefing",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "briefing",
            "text": "Welcome, commissioning crew. Build the assigned virtual cyber lab and demonstrate its weaknesses for your stakeholders. Collect the exercise PDF at Mission Briefing. Follow the lower deck left to right, turn up at the far end, and return along the upper deck. Complete each checkpoint to unlock the next.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "id": "route",
                "label": "What is the launch sequence?",
                "to": "route"
              },
              {
                "id": "evidence",
                "label": "What should I record?",
                "to": "evidence"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "route",
            "text": "Mission briefing → Kali, Ubuntu, and Metasploitable addresses → SQL diagnostic analysis → nginx hosting → Webmin version research → Webmin endpoint verification → remote-host analysis → individual debrief. All question references match the attached exercise PDF. Use your Journal to revisit completed checkpoints. After the final debrief, enter the Celebration Airlock at the top-left of the deck to meet the cheering crew and see the trophy display.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "id": "back",
                "label": "Back to briefing",
                "to": "briefing"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "evidence",
            "text": "Keep your exercise PDF open while you work in the assigned VMs. The deck records answers to the original scored questions. Complete the individual write-up and send it using the instructions at the final checkpoint. Entering OK records acknowledgment; it does not send your document.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "id": "back",
                "label": "Back to briefing",
                "to": "briefing"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "celebration-instructor",
        "name": "Lab Instructor",
        "characterId": "launch-controller",
        "map": "celebration-hall",
        "location": {
          "x": 20,
          "y": 13
        },
        "startNode": "congratulations",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "congratulations",
            "text": "Congratulations You Completed the Assignment! You brought the lab online and followed the exercise through to the individual debrief. Take a moment to celebrate your work!",
